   7:     """
   8:     Create a four-quadrant mirror pattern from the whole input grid.
   9: 
  10:     Input structure:
  11:     - The entire rectangular input grid is the seed tile.
  12: 
  13:     Rule:
  14:     - Place the input tile in the upper-left quadrant.
  15:     - Place its left-to-right reflection in the upper-right quadrant.
  16:     - Reflect that full top strip top-to-bottom to make the lower half.
  17: 
  18:     Key insight:
  19:     - The output is a 2x2 reflection tiling, not a pixelwise scale-up.
  20:     """
